      "title": "Model download",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux.1 Schnell (GGUF Q4) Flat-Color Workflow\n\nUNET replaced with GGUF **Q4_K_S** (city96) via ComfyUI-GGUF `UnetLoaderGGUF`.\nText encoders (clip_l + t5xxl_fp8) and VAE stay as safetensors.\n\n### Diffusion model (GGUF, ~6.3GB) - already downloaded to models/unet/\n- **flux1-schnell-Q4_K_S.gguf** (city96/FLUX.1-schnell-gguf)\n  ModelScope: https://modelscope.cn/models/city96/FLUX.1-schnell-gguf/resolve/master/flux1-schnell-Q4_K_S.gguf\n  Alt Q4: flux1-schnell-Q4_0.gguf (slightly larger). More quality? Q8_0 / F16.\n\n### Text encoders & VAE (already present)\n- text_encoders / clip_l.safetensors\n- text_encoders / t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n- vae / ae.safetensors\n\n### Requirements\n- Custom node `ComfyUI-GGUF` (city96) installed in custom_nodes/.\n- Python pkg `gguf>=0.13.0` installed in ComfyUI python.\n\n### Notes\n- KSampler: steps=4, cfg=1.0, sampler=euler, scheduler=simple (Schnell defaults).\n- ImageColorQuantize palette L8 keeps the output as clean solid blocks.\n- Switch node 9 mode to 'cel' for harder 2-tone shading.\n- Restart ComfyUI after adding the GGUF node so it registers.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
